          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"week-11-check-the-ais-answers\">Week 11: check the AI's answers</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Deliverable:</strong> ten test questions with known answers; where your agent is wrong, and why.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Last week your agent answered questions. This week you find out <strong>how often it is right</strong>. The method\nis old and simple: ask questions you already know the answer to.</span>\n<ol>\n<li>The notebook computes the true answer to ten questions <strong>from the layer itself</strong> (nothing typed in by hand).</li>\n<li>You ask your week-10 agent the same ten questions and record what it said.</li>\n<li>The notebook scores each answer and sorts the mistakes by kind: wrong number, wrong period,\n   treated a suppressed value as zero, answered a question the data can't answer.</li>\n<li>You read every verdict and overrule the scorer where it is wrong. That is the human's job.</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The questions are about the <strong>course default layer</strong> (the same one week 10 uses by default).</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
