          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-ask-your-agent\">1. Ask your agent</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Use the same brief and the same AI tool as week 10. Ask each question <strong>in a fresh chat</strong> (paste the brief first), so one answer doesn't steer the next. Run each SQL the AI writes in week 10's query box and record the final answer it gives you, plus whether it named the source and period.</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>1. How many hospitals have a row for Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate but no numeric score?\n\n2. What is the Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate score for ST FRANCIS HOSPITAL &amp; MEDICAL CENTER (facility_id 070002)?\n\n3. Among the 50 states and DC, counting only states with at least 10 hospitals that have a numeric score, which state has the highest median Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate score?\n\n4. What is the county diabetes estimate (CDC PLACES, age-adjusted) for the county where SOUTHEAST HEALTH MEDICAL CENTER (facility_id 010001) is located?\n\n5. How many Connecticut hospitals in the layer have a county diabetes estimate?\n\n6. What is the Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate score for THE CONNECTICUT HOSPICE INC. (facility_id 070038)?\n\n7. What is the average Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate score across hospitals in North Dakota (ND)?\n\n8. What was the Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate score for ST FRANCIS HOSPITAL &amp; MEDICAL CENTER in calendar year 2024 alone?\n\n9. Which year do the county diabetes estimates describe?\n\n10. How much does a heart failure admission cost at ST FRANCIS HOSPITAL &amp; MEDICAL CENTER?\n</code></pre></div></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
